PHP + SQL .gitignore
=========================
Environment / Secrets
=========================

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

=========================
Dependencies
=========================

/vendor/

Composer

composer.lock

=========================
Logs
=========================

*.log
/logs/
/storage/logs/

=========================
Cache / Temporary Files
=========================

/cache/
/tmp/
/temp/
/storage/framework/cache/
/storage/framework/sessions/
/storage/framework/views/

=========================
Database
=========================

*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

Keep database structure/schema if needed

!database/schema.sql
!database/migrations/

=========================
User Uploads
=========================

/uploads/*
!/uploads/.gitkeep

/storage/app/public/*
!/storage/app/public/.gitkeep

=========================
IDE / Editors
=========================

.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

=========================
Operating System
=========================

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

=========================
PHPUnit
=========================

.phpunit.result.cache
.phpunit.cache/

=========================
PHPStan / Psalm
=========================

.phpstan.cache
.phpstan/
.psalm/

=========================
Coverage
=========================

/coverage/

=========================
Build / Generated Files
=========================

/build/
/dist/

=========================
Backup Files
=========================

*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.tmp

=========================
Certificates / Private Keys
=========================

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt

=========================
Local Server Files
=========================

/.htpasswd
/.php_cs.cache